---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy">
  <section class="page-intro shell-reading">
    <div class="section-kicker">Privacy</div>
    <h1>Privacy without theatre.</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="shell-reading article-body">
    <p>BEN ON DELIVERY collects only the information you choose to provide, together with limited technical information needed to operate, secure and deliver the website.</p>

    <h2>Contact form</h2>
    <p>Name, email and message are required. Phone is optional. Contact form submissions are processed by Web3Forms and are used to respond to you and manage the conversation. Web3Forms may process the information you submit, along with technical information associated with the request, in order to deliver the form submission.</p>

    <h2>Comments</h2>
    <p>Comments are hosted by Cusdis. You may be asked to provide a name and email address when commenting. Your email is not displayed publicly. Comments are moderated before publication. Cusdis may process comment content and related technical information in order to provide and protect the commenting service.</p>

    <h2>Hosting and infrastructure</h2>
    <p>This website is hosted and delivered through Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may process technical information such as IP address, request information, security signals and other data required to operate, protect and deliver the site.</p>

    <h2>Fonts and embedded services</h2>
    <p>The site currently loads fonts from Google Fonts and may embed third-party services where needed. Those services may receive technical information such as your IP address and browser information when their resources are loaded.</p>

    <h2>How information is used</h2>
    <p>Information provided through the site is used only for purposes reasonably connected with the interaction, including replying to enquiries, moderating comments, maintaining site security and operating the publication. BEN ON DELIVERY does not sell personal information.</p>

    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>Information may be retained for as long as reasonably necessary to manage the relevant conversation, maintain records, moderate discussion, protect the site or meet applicable legal obligations.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>If you want information you have provided through BEN ON DELIVERY corrected or removed, use the contact form and identify the relevant submission or comment.</p>

    <h2>Third parties</h2>
    <p>The main third-party services currently used by this site are Cloudflare for hosting and delivery, Web3Forms for contact form processing, Cusdis for comments and Google Fonts for typography. Each service operates under its own privacy terms.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>This page may be updated as the site, its features or the services it uses change.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
